  "bodyHash": "21974ac82e9f02d5",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">本模组旨在实现</span> </span><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic fight</a></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"> <span style=\"color:#fff\">与</span> </span><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:24px\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/solo-craft-reawakening\" rel=\"nofollow\">Solo Leveling: Reawakening</a></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">SL:R + EF 兼容模组的增强版。增强版为独特的匕首和部分专属武器添加了新动画</span></span><br><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>模组的数据包版本位于</strong></span><strong><span style=\"color:#169179\"><a style=\"color:#169179\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sl-r-and-epic-fight-compat-extended\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#fff\">需要安装的 Epic Fight 附加模组有：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weapons of Miracles</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-resurrection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight:Resurrection</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">建议搭配使用</span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/solo-leveling-arsenal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">Solo Leveling Arsenal</span></a> <span style=\"color:#fff\">以获得武器的 3D 模型</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">如果您对 SL:R 模组有任何疑问：</span> <span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f36ejJENP74\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord（SL:R 官方频道）</a></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#fff\">快速解决每日任务动画不显示的问题：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1. 按 Esc 键 - Mods</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2. 在搜索栏输入：Epic fight</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">3. 点击“config”</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">4. 然后点击“Graphics”</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">5. Filter Animation（过滤动画）：On（开启）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#fff\">第一人称视角快速修复：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1. 按 Esc 键 - Mods</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2. 在搜索栏输入：Epic fight</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">3. 点击“config”</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">4. 然后点击“Graphics”</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">5. First person model（第一人称模型）：OFF（关闭）</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#fff\">将 Epic Fight 的战斗按键重新绑定到其他按键（如 F4）。之后您仍可使用 R 键释放 SLR 技能。</span></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div></div>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
